OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after police rooftop
OL,4,Aincident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 36-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of assault after an incident
OL,8,Fon a major road in Coventry.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police were called to
OL,11,FFoleshill Road at about 14:00 BST on
OL,12,FTuesday, after reports of a man on the
OL,13,Froof of a building.
OL,15,FThe road was cordoned off while
OL,16,Femergency services remained at the
OL,17,Fscene for several hours. The road
OL,18,Freopened at about 17:30 BST, according
OL,19,Fto the council.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
